d at a glance\nA light hint system for the boards that make you pause and think\nWorks fully offline — perfect for commutes, waiting rooms, or wind-down time\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nLook over the board and find three identical tiles\nTap them to clear the set\nKeep clearing until the board is empty\nMove to the next layout and see what's changed\n\nTriMatch: Tile Puzzle keeps things simple by design — no events, no forced timers, no constant pop-ups. It's a puzzle app built to be picked up for two minutes or two hours, whichever your day calls for.\nNew tile sets and board layouts are added over time, so there's always something a little different waiting the next time you open the app.\nDeveloped by Sarah Aymen.", "sellerUrl": "https://fun-hive-games-website.vercel.app/", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "127986688", "formattedPrice": "무료", "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "averageUserRating": 0, "trackCensoredName": "Tri Match: Tile Puzzle", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/tri-match-tile-puzzle/id6787373378?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "primaryGenreName": "Games", "primaryGenreId": 6014, "price": 0.0, "genres": ["게임", "캐주얼", "퍼즐"], "trackId": 6787373378, "trackName": "Tri Match: Tile Puzzle", "userRatingCount": 0}]}